<title>USA: N.Y. metal futures opening forecasts.</title>
<headline>N.Y. metal futures opening forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York metals futures were called to open by traders as follows:</p>
<p>COMEX Dec gold - up $1.00 to $1.50 an ounce</p>
<p>COMEX Sept silver - up 2 to 3 cents</p>
<p>NYMEX Oct platinum - up $2.00</p>
<p>NYMEX Sept palladium - up $2.00</p>
<p>COMEX Sept copper - down 0.30 to 0.40 cent a lb</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1640))</p>
</text>
